From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: IvyCZE <me@ivy.yt>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 20:10:30 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Embermine: 0006-material-shapes

Add the EmbermineShape enum (MaterialShapes), the ShapedIconBackground
helper (40 dp primaryContainer container behind the icon, drawn without
changing layout), and EmbermineShapeDrawable for View toolbars. Opt in
main menu items, the library row, the bottom navigation row, the account
avatar and the site protection panel rows, leaving the other menus
unshaped. Add a JVM test for the shape mapping.

Part 2 shapes the toolbar, tab strip, homepage and search bar. The
address bar menu and site security shield take Sunny and Cookie6Sided
through ActionButtonRes.shape, set only for Source.AddressBar, so the
bottom navigation bar stays unshaped. The tab close X takes Flower, the
homepage stories icon and private button take Cookie12Sided, top site
cards take Cookie6Sided, search engine selector items take Cookie12Sided,
and the search bar mic, Lens and QR buttons take Sunny.

Co-authored-by: factory-droid[bot] <138933559+factory-droid[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>

